1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:06,289
An AI that answers texts and calls should not trap a customer who needs a person.

2
00:00:06,289 --> 00:00:10,667
This video shows how an AI conversation is handed to a live agent:

3
00:00:10,667 --> 00:00:15,773
the queue, the subject's handoff settings, where a text lands, what happens to

4
00:00:15,773 --> 00:00:18,570
a call, and the summary the agent reads.

5
00:00:23,170 --> 00:00:25,983
The AI is good at the first questions.

6
00:00:25,983 --> 00:00:30,011
When a customer asks for a person, is ready to buy, or is

7
00:00:30,011 --> 00:00:33,080
frustrated, a live agent should take over.

8
00:00:33,830 --> 00:00:38,292
Live agent handoff passes the conversation from the AI to a queue of

9
00:00:38,292 --> 00:00:41,970
people, and the agent sees what the AI already learned.

10
00:00:42,720 --> 00:00:48,480
It is set on the subject, so every conversation of that subject follows the same rules.

11
00:00:52,692 --> 00:00:55,239
Handoff needs a queue to hand to.

12
00:00:55,239 --> 00:01:00,137
Under Interaction Center, Queues, click Add Queue and give it a name.

13
00:01:00,137 --> 00:01:02,292
Here it is the Sales queue.

14
00:01:02,744 --> 00:01:08,620
Under Hours and overflow, choose a business hours calendar, here the showroom hours.

15
00:01:08,620 --> 00:01:12,798
While the queue is closed, a call handed over is not held:

16
00:01:12,798 --> 00:01:15,279
a callback is scheduled instead.

17
00:01:15,279 --> 00:01:16,324
Then save.

18
00:01:20,525 --> 00:01:21,915
Now the subject.

19
00:01:21,915 --> 00:01:26,529
Open the Dealership Inquiry subject's Omnichannel Subject settings.

20
00:01:26,529 --> 00:01:31,585
Make it automated on the SMS channel, and pick the address customers text.

21
00:01:32,035 --> 00:01:38,598
Under AI configuration, choose the AI profile and write the subject goal in plain words.

22
00:01:38,598 --> 00:01:43,625
The no-response timeout and the reply delay pace the conversation.

23
00:01:44,076 --> 00:01:47,293
The Live agent handoff card is the switch.

24
00:01:47,293 --> 00:01:51,449
Turn on Allow the AI to hand off to a live agent, choose

25
00:01:51,449 --> 00:01:53,928
the Sales queue, and tick when:

26
00:01:53,928 --> 00:01:59,424
the customer asks for a human, is a qualified, ready lead, or is frustrated.

27
00:01:59,424 --> 00:02:00,496
Then save.

28
00:02:04,696 --> 00:02:07,077
The AI hands off in three cases:

29
00:02:07,077 --> 00:02:11,901
the customer asks for a human, the customer is a qualified, ready lead,

30
00:02:11,901 --> 00:02:15,534
or the customer is frustrated or the AI cannot help.

31
00:02:15,534 --> 00:02:17,726
Tick only the cases you want.

32
00:02:18,476 --> 00:02:23,721
Without a queue, or with none of the cases ticked, the AI never hands off.

33
00:02:23,721 --> 00:02:28,506
Handing off a text conversation also needs the Messaging workspace.

34
00:02:29,256 --> 00:02:33,387
The AI tells the customer, in its own words, that it is connecting

35
00:02:33,387 --> 00:02:34,706
them to a person.

36
00:02:38,915 --> 00:02:43,855
A text conversation handed over appears in the Messaging inbox, for the agents

37
00:02:43,855 --> 00:02:45,383
who serve the queue.

38
00:02:45,383 --> 00:02:49,558
The agent claims it, reads what the AI and the customer said, and

39
00:02:49,558 --> 00:02:51,969
replies from the same conversation.

40
00:02:51,969 --> 00:02:56,555
The inbox is empty here because the AI has not handed anything over yet.

41
00:03:00,755 --> 00:03:03,802
A call handed over rings the agents of the queue.

42
00:03:03,802 --> 00:03:07,015
The AI first tells the caller it is connecting them.

43
00:03:07,765 --> 00:03:11,755
When nobody in the queue is free, the caller hears that they are

44
00:03:11,755 --> 00:03:14,775
in the queue, and holds until an agent answers.

45
00:03:15,525 --> 00:03:19,167
When the queue is closed, a callback is booked instead.

46
00:03:19,167 --> 00:03:23,345
The caller hears that someone will call back, and the call ends.

47
00:03:27,545 --> 00:03:31,738
The agent who takes the activity starts from the AI assistant's summary:

48
00:03:31,738 --> 00:03:35,501
a blue banner on the Complete page with what the AI learned, and

49
00:03:35,501 --> 00:03:36,738
when it wrote it.

50
00:03:36,738 --> 00:03:38,995
It is not part of the agent's notes.

51
00:03:39,745 --> 00:03:46,042
On the completed activity, Review AI conversation opens the full transcript, read-only.

52
00:03:46,042 --> 00:03:50,375
The activity records that the AI handed the customer over.

53
00:03:54,575 --> 00:03:58,784
Let the AI answer a sales line, and take over when a customer

54
00:03:58,784 --> 00:04:00,165
is ready to buy.

55
00:04:00,915 --> 00:04:04,705
Hand a frustrated customer to a person at once.

56
00:04:05,455 --> 00:04:10,305
Book a callback for the calls that arrive after hours, instead of losing them.

57
00:04:11,055 --> 00:04:15,925
Keep one queue for each team, and hand each subject to the right one.

58
00:04:17,925 --> 00:04:21,658
Let the AI do the first conversation, and give it a queue to

59
00:04:21,658 --> 00:04:25,165
hand to, so a person takes over exactly when it matters.

60
00:04:25,165 --> 00:04:26,635
Thanks for watching.

